{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "edd35afb-d13a-8691-a1a3-30b756f6e673",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T12:48:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivan Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:46:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:46:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I need to find out about a curb cut. For a driveway. I rent, so I'm guessing this is going to be a runaround."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:46:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Shouldn't be too bad. Is it a new curb cut, or widening one that's already there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:46:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "New. There's no driveway now, just curb. I'm at 255 Admiral Kalbfus Road, North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. First thing, you're renting, so your landlord would have to be on board. The owner usually has to sign the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:47:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, I'll ask him. Sorry, I'm a little scattered. Just got off an argument with my teenager about curfew. Anyway. Who do I hire to do it? And who actually approves it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:47:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. For the work, you'd hire a licensed paving or excavation contractor who does curb and driveway openings. Ask them if they've pulled these in Newport before. Approval goes through the city, usually Public Services along with our office, depending on the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:47:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So two offices. Great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:47:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not so bad, the application starts with us and we route it. Most contractors handle the paperwork."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:47:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Does it need an inspection?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:47:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, generally there's an inspection once the work's done, before it's signed off. Your contractor would schedule it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:47:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And I just get the application from you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:48:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, come by the office or I can have it emailed. Want to leave a number in case I need to call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Talk to your landlord first, then we'll go from there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:48:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks."
    }
  ],
